                                                "sense_id": "660b2261-9576-36d8-9238-decc0ea11914",
                                                "text": "Below and to rearward circles the Tweed, silver grey on a dark brown field. Beside its low banks no tourists linger, vacant hangs the quivering bridge; down the narrow lanes no carriages come pressing over a succession of waving hills[…]"
